      "category": "diet",
      "title": "均衡饮食如何改变身体状态",
      "summary": "合理搭配蛋白质、碳水与蔬果，让身体获得稳定能量。",
      "cover_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512621776951-a57141f2eefd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=450&q=80",
      "body": "## 均衡饮食\n\n每餐包含优质蛋白，多吃蔬菜水果，控制精加工食品。",
      "published": true,
      "sort_order": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-06-22T02:42:11.169Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-13T08:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "category": "lifestyle",
      "title": "固定起床时间的力量",
      "summary": "即使周末也尽量保持相近的起床时刻，生物钟会更稳定。",
      "cover_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=450&q=80",
      "body": "## 固定起床\n\n尝试将起床时间波动控制在 **30 分钟以内**，减少「社交时差」。",
      "published": true,
      "sort_order": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-06-22T02:42:11.169Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-14T08:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "category": "exercise",
      "title": "晨间散步如何开启活力一天",
      "summary": "清晨适度活动可以促进血液循环，让身体更快苏醒。",
      "cover_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1416879595882-3373a0480b5b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=450&q=80",
      "body": "## 晨间散步建议\n\n每天 **15～30 分钟** 即可，不必追求强度。",
      "published": true,
      "sort_order": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-06-22T02:42:11.169Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-15T08:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "category": "exercise",
      "title": "午后拉伸缓解久坐疲劳",
      "summary": "简短拉伸能放松颈肩腰背，改善久坐带来的僵硬感。",
      "cover_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518611012118-696072aa579a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&h=450&q=80",
      "body": "## 办公拉伸\n\n每工作 **45 分钟** 起身活动 3 分钟。",
      "published": true,
      "sort_order": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-06-22T02:42:11.169Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-16T08:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
